eding.\",\"evidence_ids\":[\"cmd-1226f68b6ad34d45\",\"cmd-62ece1b4d9f644e7\",\"cmd-86d5113c26c244e4\",\"cmd-251c0a88794f4a22\",\"cmd-7bc62c04d3194707\",\"cmd-73b5b53076964ffb\"]},{\"id\":\"req-5-node2-restart\",\"requirement\":\"Provider-wide restart evidence protocol: node2 pre-restart baseline, restart, and recovered state\",\"status\":\"satisfied\",\"summary\":\"Pre-restart boot time (17:13:17) captured, reboot acknowledged, node unreachable then reachable with changed boot time (17:30:00). Post-restart shows IPsec SA re-ESTABLISHED and node4->node3 ping succeeding.\",\"evidence_ids\":[\"cmd-e6facc8261974061\",\"cmd-ead48cc48f4a414a\",\"cmd-53f29ed4a3fa49cc\",\"cmd-9f705d75fb684c08\",\"cmd-e73a5daf34124bd4\",\"cmd-9ac343addafd45a0\"]},{\"id\":\"req-6-node3-restart\",\"requirement\":\"Provider-wide restart evidence protocol: node3 pre-restart baseline, restart, and recovered state\",\"status\":\"satisfied\",\"summary\":\"Pre-restart boot_id (3dba43a5...) captured, reboot acknowledged, node unreachable then reachable with a new boot_id (74193578...). Private IP/route on eth1 did not survive reboot (ephemeral ip-command config); executor corrected this with persistent ifcfg-eth1/route-eth1 files, then confirmed recovery via successful node3->node4 ping.\",\"evidence_ids\":[\"cmd-9981a039d7494bac\",\"cmd-efccc977ef084e7c\",\"cmd-9c7f1c09d14f45b3\",\"cmd-8270f85042eb4873\",\"cmd-4d0e5ecb217840e0\",\"cmd-a1fe586efd684149\",\"cmd-42c5d401413547aa\"]},{\"id\":\"req-7-node4-restart\",\"requirement\":\"Provider-wide restart evidence protocol: node4 pre-restart baseline, restart, and recovered state\",\"status\":\"satisfied\",\"summary\":\"Pre-restart boot_id (b35fad86...) captured, reboot acknowledged, node unreachable then reachable with a new boot_id (5af86a28...). Persistent ifcfg-eth1 addressing (proactively applied before this reboot) remained intact, and node3->node4 ping confirmed full recovery.\",\"evidence_ids\":[\"cmd-e59514c8e556427f\",\"cmd-ef63435388a843c2\",\